program	printable_interp_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot interpolate value of type `Bare` in a string: it is not `Printable`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot interpolate value of type `Bare` in a string: it is not `Printable`"
log	"  --> examples/printable_interp_error.saw:10:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 10 |     print(\"{b}\")"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: conform it with `extension Bare: Printable { ... }`"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
